entries[120978] = { ["name"] = "Ashbringer", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nUnique\nTwo-Hand Sword\n3 - 7 Damage Speed 3.60\n(1.4 damage per second)\n+2 Strength\n+3 Stamina\n+ 2 Critical Strike\n+ 2 Mastery\n\nHoly Artifact Relic Slot\nFire Artifact Relic Slot\n\nClasses: Paladin\nEquip: Grants you the Wake of Ashes ability, which deals massive damage to enemies in an area. (Proc chance: 10%)\n\"So it was that over the course of time, the man and the weapon seemed as one. Ashbringer became a name of legend, attributed not just to the fearsome blade but also to the relentless knight who wielded it.\"\nSell Price:" }
